{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-15","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If an unit measure any number, and another number measure any other number the same number of times, alternately also, the unit will measure the third number the same number of times that the second measures the fourth.","book":7,"number":15,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.15","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.15/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":15,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-15@raw-11b6be231e245922","contentId":"euclid-7-15","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"11b6be231e24592256de520aa63369c967a0eec86bfb653f92b1e1681c9f1674","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-15.statement","euclid-7-15.construction.1","euclid-7-15.proof.1","euclid-7-15.construction.2","euclid-7-15.proof.2","euclid-7-15.proof.3","euclid-7-15.proof.4","euclid-7-15.proof.5","euclid-7-15.proof.6","euclid-7-15.conclusion","euclid-7-15.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-15.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-15","revisionId":"euclid-7-15@raw-11b6be231e245922","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"08016de4f5f7c8e944b9b5ab7a6a586973939c30b312c13acab3cbbdb71c99e6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an unit measure any number, and another number measure any other number the same number of times, alternately also, the unit will measure the third number the same number of times that the second measures the fourth."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个单位 整除个数字,另一个整除个数字,任何其他数字相同,则同样,单位个数字将第三个数字与第二个整除个数字的第四个数字相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-15.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-15","revisionId":"euclid-7-15@raw-11b6be231e245922","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb45c373db963a4ddbfee4ae73b7e3b09f1139874a7c3fe7eaaa9800929119a6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the unit A measure any number BC, and let another number D measure any other number EF the same number of times; I say that, alternately also, the unit A measures the number D the same number of times that BC measures EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何号码为单位 A 整除的单位,再号码为D 整除的EF名其他号码为同样次数;我说,换句话说,单位 A 整除的数字是D 整除的D倍。（相关点与线段：BC）"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-15.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-15","revisionId":"euclid-7-15@raw-11b6be231e245922","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"504a8df1ef9b8f676b4c4d48cbb7f0a90c20831522286d3449561f9805c92712","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the unit A measures the number BC the same number of times that D measures EF, therefore, as many units as there are in BC, so many numbers equal to D are there in EF also."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,自单位 A 整除数字以来,BC数字是D 整除 EF数字的两倍,因此,BC数字与BC数字是单位倍,EF数字也等于D数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-15.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-15","revisionId":"euclid-7-15@raw-11b6be231e245922","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b0bd89dc3c5e651424b527ed0080a9d2c087f20cee02e98f9fce725c2d1c65d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let BC be divided into the units in it, BG, GH, HC, and EF into the numbers EK, KL, LF equal to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC分为单位,BG、GH、HC和EF分为EK、KL、LF等,相当于D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-15.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-15","revisionId":"euclid-7-15@raw-11b6be231e245922","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4c8a273def94257086c77a45beabb2dd9ce053b363c4ef7877d3d57733dfe050","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus the multitude of BG, GH, HC will be equal to the multitude of EK, KL, LF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BG、GH、HC等量将等于EK、KL、LF等量。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-15.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-15","revisionId":"euclid-7-15@raw-11b6be231e245922","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4c7f67d8430ccbc112ddac17155bbaf44d70f3baadfd7f65beab6fcbf856229a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the units BG, GH, HC are equal to one another, and the numbers EK, KL, LF are also equal to one another, while the multitude of the units BG, GH, HC is equal to the multitude of the numbers EK, KL, LF, therefore, as the unit BG is to the number EK, so will the unit GH be to the number KL, and the unit HC to the number LF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于单位 BG,GH,HC是相互等同的,EK,KL,LF是相互等同的,而单位 BG,GH,EK的众多数量与EK,KL,LF的众多数量相等,因此,单位 BG是EK,单位、GH是KL,单位、HC是LF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-15.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-15","revisionId":"euclid-7-15@raw-11b6be231e245922","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6c5af1bb1afab501b14d90a1700b51ded23453d6fe5e2f8f43ff4c71ac98db80","citations":["euclid-7-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as one of the antecedents is to one of the consequents, so will all the antecedents be to all the consequents; [[VII. 12](/principles/euclid-7-12)] therefore, as the unit BG is to the number EK, so is BC to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,由于前例之一就是后果之一,因此,前例也是所有后果;因此,单位 BG与EK的比等于BC与EF的比。 [[VII. 12](/principles/euclid-7-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-15.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-15","revisionId":"euclid-7-15@raw-11b6be231e245922","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1242cc147c651e1bb5543c950a551b81354b723ca78cc6d23f07262c0d1245e4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit BG is equal to the unit A, and the number EK to the number D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但单位 BG等于单位 A, EK等于D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-15.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-15","revisionId":"euclid-7-15@raw-11b6be231e245922","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"85379a8f21502b446d3cb6be97e78d6ef695e277f6a1ae2a5ac9c39f70ec1a71","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as the unit A is to the number D, so is BC to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,单位 A与D的比等于BC与EF的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-15.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-15","revisionId":"euclid-7-15@raw-11b6be231e245922","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4d0b3ad6c2e04bd829340a5ef872579836460507f9f52288907dcea91002d949","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the unit A measures the number D the same number of times that BC measures EF. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,单位 A 整除 这个数字是D BC 整除 EF 证毕。 的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-15.source","contentId":"euclid-7-15","revisionId":"euclid-7-15@raw-11b6be231e245922","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2f3573e74ea816bdf5f5c147ce0f382c10b2bf6ade0dd7d9930ea18d9224887d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.15/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.15\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-15:euclid-7-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-15.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-12","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"VII. 12"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-16:euclid-7-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-16.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.16","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.16/","sourceLabel":"VII. 15"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-37